  <!-- EN: Mountain lover -->
  <VTE_ChildOfMountain.stages.Mountain_lover.label>山地愛好者</VTE_ChildOfMountain.stages.Mountain_lover.label>
  <!-- EN: I just love being around the mountains, they take my breath away. -->
  <VTE_ChildOfMountain.stages.Mountain_lover.description>我就是喜歡呆在山的周圍，它們讓我嘆為觀止。</VTE_ChildOfMountain.stages.Mountain_lover.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Ocean lover -->
  <VTE_ChildOfSea.stages.Ocean_lover.label>海洋愛好者</VTE_ChildOfSea.stages.Ocean_lover.label>
  <!-- EN: I just love being around the ocean and rivers, water is beautiful. -->
  <VTE_ChildOfSea.stages.Ocean_lover.description>我就喜歡待在大海和河流周圍。水是美麗的。</VTE_ChildOfSea.stages.Ocean_lover.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Сould not finish item -->
  <VTE_CouldNotFinishItem.stages.ould_not_finish_item.label>沒法做完物品</VTE_CouldNotFinishItem.stages.ould_not_finish_item.label>
  <!-- EN: I couldn't finish my project, it just wasn't coming along correctly. -->
  <VTE_CouldNotFinishItem.stages.ould_not_finish_item.description>我沒法做完那個物品。它就是不能如我所願。</VTE_CouldNotFinishItem.stages.ould_not_finish_item.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Created low quality item -->
  <VTE_CreatedLowQualityItem.stages.Created_low_quality_item.label>製作了低品質的物品</VTE_CreatedLowQualityItem.stages.Created_low_quality_item.label>
  <!-- EN: I crafted junk. I feel like I can't do anything right. -->
  <VTE_CreatedLowQualityItem.stages.Created_low_quality_item.description>我做了個垃圾出來。我覺得自己什麽都做不好。</VTE_CreatedLowQualityItem.stages.Created_low_quality_item.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Dunce -->
  <VTE_Dunce.stages.Dunce.label>真蠢</VTE_Dunce.stages.Dunce.label>
  <!-- EN: I don't really understand why everybody's so upset all the time. -->
  <VTE_Dunce.stages.Dunce.description>我真的不明白為什麼其他人總是如此沮喪。</VTE_Dunce.stages.Dunce.description>
  
  <!-- EN: darkness -->
  <VTE_EnvironmentDark.stages.darkness.label>黑暗的環境</VTE_EnvironmentDark.stages.darkness.label>
  <!-- EN: I've been in the dark for a while. I like it. -->
  <VTE_EnvironmentDark.stages.darkness.description>我已經在黑暗中待了一段時間了。我喜歡這樣。</VTE_EnvironmentDark.stages.darkness.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Harvested organs -->
  <VTE_HarvestedOrgans.stages.Harvested_organs.label>采摘器官</VTE_HarvestedOrgans.stages.Harvested_organs.label>
  <!-- EN: The operation went just as expected, my collection has grown. -->
  <VTE_HarvestedOrgans.stages.Harvested_organs.description>手術如期進行，我的藏品也越來越多。</VTE_HarvestedOrgans.stages.Harvested_organs.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Has not left colony -->
  <VTE_HaventExitedColonyForLongTime.stages.Has_not_left_colony.label>沒有離開殖民地</VTE_HaventExitedColonyForLongTime.stages.Has_not_left_colony.label>
  <!-- EN: I haven't left home in a while, I'd really like to travel for a change. -->
  <VTE_HaventExitedColonyForLongTime.stages.Has_not_left_colony.description>我已經很久沒有離開家了。真想去旅行換換口味。</VTE_HaventExitedColonyForLongTime.stages.Has_not_left_colony.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Hasn't harvested organs -->
  <VTE_HaventHarvestedOrgansForLongTime.stages.Hasnt_harvested_organs.label>沒有采摘器官</VTE_HaventHarvestedOrgansForLongTime.stages.Hasnt_harvested_organs.label>
  <!-- EN: I'm growing impatient and bored, I need more subjects. -->
  <VTE_HaventHarvestedOrgansForLongTime.stages.Hasnt_harvested_organs.description>我越來越不耐煩，越來越無聊。我需要更多的實驗！</VTE_HaventHarvestedOrgansForLongTime.stages.Hasnt_harvested_organs.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Mechanoid died -->
  <VTE_MechanoidIsKilled.stages.Mechanoid_died.label>機械族死亡</VTE_MechanoidIsKilled.stages.Mechanoid_died.label>
  <!-- EN: Those evil machines don't deserve to function. -->
  <VTE_MechanoidIsKilled.stages.Mechanoid_died.description>那些邪惡的鐵皮機器不配出現在這個世界上。</VTE_MechanoidIsKilled.stages.Mechanoid_died.description>
  
  <!-- EN: My rivals are alive -->
  <VTE_MyRivalsAreAlive.stages.My_rivals_are_alive.label>我的死對頭還活著</VTE_MyRivalsAreAlive.stages.My_rivals_are_alive.label>
  <!-- EN: I hate them. Why should they deserve to live? -->
  <VTE_MyRivalsAreAlive.stages.My_rivals_are_alive.description>我討厭跟我作對的人。為什麽要讓那些家夥活得好好的？</VTE_MyRivalsAreAlive.stages.My_rivals_are_alive.description>
  
  <!-- EN: No dedicated laboratory -->
  <VTE_NoDedicatedLaboratory.stages.No_dedicated_laboratory.label>沒有專門的實驗室</VTE_NoDedicatedLaboratory.stages.No_dedicated_laboratory.label>
  <!-- EN: I have nowhere to study in peace, how annoying. -->
  <VTE_NoDedicatedLaboratory.stages.No_dedicated_laboratory.description>我無處安身學習，真煩。</VTE_NoDedicatedLaboratory.stages.No_dedicated_laboratory.description>
  
  <!-- EN: observed much blood -->
  <VTE_ObservedManyBlood.stages.observed_much_blood.label>看到許多血</VTE_ObservedManyBlood.stages.observed_much_blood.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw so much blood and bits. Just remembering it makes me gag. -->
  <VTE_ObservedManyBlood.stages.observed_much_blood.description>我看到了許多的血和肉渣。光是回憶起來，我就覺得噁心。</VTE_ObservedManyBlood.stages.observed_much_blood.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Passionately cleaning -->
  <VTE_PassionateCleaningWork.stages.Passionately_cleaning.label>充滿激情的清潔</VTE_PassionateCleaningWork.stages.Passionately_cleaning.label>
  <!-- EN: I actually really enjoy organizing and cleaning up the place. -->
  <VTE_PassionateCleaningWork.stages.Passionately_cleaning.description>其實我真的很喜歡清理這裡。</VTE_PassionateCleaningWork.stages.Passionately_cleaning.description>
  
  <!-- EN: soaking wet -->
  <VTE_SoakingWetChildOfTheSea.stages.soaking_wet.label>濕透了</VTE_SoakingWetChildOfTheSea.stages.soaking_wet.label>
  <!-- EN: I'm soaking wet. Love it. -->
  <VTE_SoakingWetChildOfTheSea.stages.soaking_wet.description>我濕透了。爽到~</VTE_SoakingWetChildOfTheSea.stages.soaking_wet.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Watched television recently -->
  <VTE_WatchedTelevisor.stages.Watched_television_recently.label>最近看了電視</VTE_WatchedTelevisor.stages.Watched_television_recently.label>
  <!-- EN: I got to laze around and catch up on my shows. -->
  <VTE_WatchedTelevisor.stages.Watched_television_recently.description>我懶趴趴地看了會電視節目。</VTE_WatchedTelevisor.stages.Watched_television_recently.description>
  
